<title>USA: Jetronic says it will file its 10-Q late.</title>
<headline>Jetronic says it will file its 10-Q late.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jetronic Industries Inc said Thursday that the American Stock Exchange halted trading on its stock because the company would be late in filing its Form 10-Q for its first quarter ended April 30.</p>
<p>A company spokesman said it was late in filing because of personnel problems on the staff.</p>
<p>Jetronic designs and makes electronic communication and navigation devices and energy conversion products.</p>
</text>
